.TH SAVE_WRITE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
save_write \- Write size bytes of data to a slot file with a header carrying version
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsave.h\(dq
.BI "bool save_write(const Save *s, const char *slot, const void *data, size_t size, uint32_t version);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write size bytes of data to a slot file with a header carrying version. data must be pointer\-free (a GameState).
.SH RETURN VALUE
true on success; failures are logged.
.SH MODULE
save (src/engine/save/save.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR save_load (3),
.BR save_exists (3),
.BR gge\-saves (7),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
